{
  "info": {
    "name": "BiblioApp API",
    "_postman_id": "biblioapp-sc403-collection",
    "description": "Coleccion del Caso Practico 2 (SC-403). Autenticacion por sesion (cookie JSESSIONID) + CSRF. Flujo sugerido: 1) Login bibliotecaria1, 2) pruebas de la API de libros, 3) GET atrasados, 4) Login lector1, 5) POST /api/libros -> 403.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticacion (sesion)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login bibliotecaria1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "bibliotecaria1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "password123", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "_csrf", "value": "{{csrf}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Loguea como BIBLIOTECARIO. El script previo obtiene el token CSRF desde el meta tag de la pagina de login y guarda la cookie de sesion."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.sendRequest(pm.variables.get('base_url') + '/login', function (err, res) {",
                  "    if (err) { console.log(err); return; }",
                  "    var m = res.text().match(/name=\"_csrf\" content=\"([^\"]+)\"/);",
                  "    if (m) { pm.variables.set('csrf', m[1]); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login lector1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "lector1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "password123", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "_csrf", "value": "{{csrf}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Loguea como LECTOR. Remplaza la cookie de sesion anterior."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.sendRequest(pm.variables.get('base_url') + '/login', function (err, res) {",
                  "    if (err) { console.log(err); return; }",
                  "    var m = res.text().match(/name=\"_csrf\" content=\"([^\"]+)\"/);",
                  "    if (m) { pm.variables.set('csrf', m[1]); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "API Libros",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/libros (publico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros"]
            },
            "description": "Catalogo completo en JSON. Publico: no requiere login."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/libros/1 (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros", "1"]
            },
            "description": "200 OK con el libro de id=1."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/libros/999 (404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros/999",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros", "999"]
            },
            "description": "Libro inexistente -> 404 sin body (ResponseEntity.notFound())."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/libros (201 bibliotecario)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"El alquimista\",\n  \"autor\": \"Paulo Coelho\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0062502174\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Ficcion\",\n  \"copiasTotales\": 3,\n  \"copiasDisponibles\": 3\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion de BIBLIOTECARIO. @Valid valida el body. 201 Created + header Location. Ejecutar tras 'Login bibliotecaria1'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/libros (400 validacion)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"\",\n  \"autor\": \"\",\n  \"isbn\": \"\",\n  \"categoria\": \"\",\n  \"copiasTotales\": 0,\n  \"copiasDisponibles\": -1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros"]
            },
            "description": "Body invalido -> 400 Bad Request por las validaciones @NotBlank/@Positive."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/libros (403 lector)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"X\",\n  \"autor\": \"Y\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0000000000\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Z\",\n  \"copiasTotales\": 1,\n  \"copiasDisponibles\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/libros",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "libros"]
            },
            "description": "Ejecutar tras 'Login lector1' (reemplaza la sesion). El lector NO tiene rol BIBLIOTECARIO -> @PreAuthorize bloquea y devuelve 403."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "API Prestamos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/prestamos/atrasados (200 bibliotecario)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/prestamos/atrasados",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "prestamos", "atrasados"]
            },
            "description": "Usa la consulta JPQL prestamosAtrasados() de PrestamoRepository (fechaDevolucion IS NULL y fechaLimite < CURRENT_DATE). Requiere BIBLIOTECARIO."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/prestamos/atrasados (403 lector)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/prestamos/atrasados",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "prestamos", "atrasados"]
            },
            "description": "Con sesion de lector -> 403 (listar atrasados es funcion del bibliotecario)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}